### REST Client sample requests (use VS Code REST Client extension or Thunder Client)

@base = http://localhost:3000

### Get server status
GET {{base}}/api/status

### List API routes
GET {{base}}/api/list

### List COM ports (filtered by manual mode)
GET {{base}}/api/com-ports

### Serial WiFi scan (adjust path)
POST {{base}}/api/serial/wifi/scan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "path": "COM10",
  "baudRate": 115200,
  "timeoutMs": 8000
}

### Device WiFi scan (networked device)
GET {{base}}/api/device/wifi/scan?host=192.168.4.2

### Device WiFi connect
POST {{base}}/api/device/wifi/connect
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "host": "192.168.4.2",
  "ssid": "MySSID",
  "password": "SecretPass"
}

### Tail server log (node)
GET {{base}}/api/log/read?name=node&lines=100

### Build artifacts
GET {{base}}/api/artifacts
